usage: alpha check [--root DIR] [FILE.unit ...]
       alpha manager [--root DIR] [--control PATH] [--kmsg]
       alpha status [UNIT] | list | watch [--format=1] [--control PATH]
       alpha start | stop | restart | reload UNIT [--control PATH]
       alpha --help | --version

alpha is the service manager for PAX. This version checks unit files in
format 1, runs the manager, which starts the boot's units and supervises
them, and asks the manager over its control socket.
